  "thesis": "The latest published U.S. Treasury 10-year minus 3-month term spread may identify macroeconomic and risk-bearing conditions before a BTC position decision. Holding full BTC only while that spread is non-negative may avoid uncompensated inversion-associated paths and improve drawdown and Calmar after costs while retaining sufficient upside.",
